   "textLength": 426,
   "text": "The Roku remote is rounder and thicker than the Fire TV remote, which is thinner and more prone to getting lost between the couch cushions. The Roku remote also has old-school arrows and an “OK” button, whereas the Fire TV remote has a circle with a round “OK” button in the middle and, you guessed it, no letters or arrows in this navigation wheel, which makes it a little less intuitive for someone",
